        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Juc Kɛ-naan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Kɛ-naan kuäär Ä-radh min cieŋ kä Nɛ-gɛb ɛ liŋ i̱, bä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p Ä-ta-rim, cuɛ nyiëëny kɛ kɛ, kä cuɛ tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn käp ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ ya̱c Kuoth Nhial wä kɛ i̱, “Mi deri nɛy ti̱ti̱ la̱th tetkäda, kɔn dëë kɔ wi̱i̱kiɛn da̱k ni piny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial jɔw ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl liŋ, kä cuɛ ji̱ Kɛ-naan la̱th tetädiɛn. Kä cukɛ kɛ da̱k ni piny amäni wi̱i̱kiɛn. Kä cua gua̱th ɛmɔ cɔl i̱ Ɣɔr-ma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɣɔr-ma",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lotdɛ ni ɣöö däk.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thɔ̱l mi ca la̱t kɛ yiëëth in do̱l",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jiɛɛn Pääm Ɣor wäkɛ Bar Gutdä gɔ̱a̱lkɛ mun ji̱ Ɛ-dɔm. Kä cu naath thil päl lɔaac piny dup. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu naath ruac a jiäk kɛ Kuoth kɛnɛ Muthɛ wäkɛ i̱, “Ɛŋu no̱o̱ŋi nɛy raar kä I-jëp ɔ kɛ ɣöö ba̱kɔ ben li̱w rɛy dɔaar ɔ? Kä thilɛ mi̱eth kä thilɛ pi̱w, kä ci nɛy ŋɔ̱a̱ŋ kɛn mi̱eth ɛ jiäk ɛ mi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial thɔ̱ɔ̱l ti na̱kɛ naath luɔny rɛy nath, cukɛ naath cam, cu nɛy ti ŋuan li̱w kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu naath ben kä Muthɛ wäkɛ i̱, “Ca̱kɔ duer kɛ ɣöö ca̱kɔ ruac a jiäk kɛ Kuoth Nhial kɛnɛ ji̱. Pal Kuoth Nhial kɛ ɣöö bɛ thɔ̱ɔ̱l woc kä nɛy.” Kä cu Muthɛ pal kɛ kui̱ nath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Muthɛ jiök i̱, “Lätni thɔ̱l, kä läthni jɛ ri̱kä. Kä ram mi ca kac ɛ thɔ̱l bɛ jɛ guic kä bɛ cu tëk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ thɔ̱l la̱t kɛ yiëëth in do̱l, kä cuɛ jɛ la̱th ri̱kä. Mi ca raan kac ɛ thɔ̱l, bɛ thɔ̱l cikä min do̱l guic kä bɛ cu tëk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ɣöth nath kä Mo-ab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ɣöth, cukɛ ben pua̱t kä O-bot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jiɛɛn kä O-bot cukɛ ben pua̱t kä Iye-ä-ba-rim rɛy dɔaar min lot ni Mo-ab kui̱ käny ca̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jiɛɛn thi̱n cukɛ ben pua̱t rɛy lo̱o̱lä Dha-rɛd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ ɣöth thi̱n cukɛ ben pua̱t kui̱ Ar-non rɛy dɔaar in wä këth ji̱ Ɛ-mor. Kɛ ɣöö ɛn Ar-non ɛ wec Mo-ab, mi te kam Mo-ab kɛnɛ Ɛ-mor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn min lat bok ko̱o̱r Kuɔth Nhial i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jiɛɛn ɛn wi̱ni cukɛ ben kä Bëër, min la jiw ëë jio̱k Kuoth Nhial Muthɛ thi̱n i̱, “Mat naath guäth kɛl, bäkɛ moc pi̱w.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl dit ɛmɛ kɛt i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Juc Thi-yon kɛnɛ Ög",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl naath jäk kä Thi-yon kuäär ji̱ Ɛ-mor wee i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jakni nɛy kä wä kɛ wecdu. /Ca̱kɔ bi wä kɛ rɛy kakä kiɛ kak wal kɛ kui̱ kɔaŋ. Ba̱kɔ luk ni rɛy duɔ̱p kua̱r in di̱i̱t, amäni mi ca̱kɔ wecdu bäl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö /ken Thi-yon ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl nhök wä kɛ rɛy wecdɛ. Cuɛ ma̱a̱t ni nɛɛkɛ diaal, cuɛ wä nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɛy dɔaar kä Yaadh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ näk, kä cukɛ wecdɛ ka̱n a känɛ ni kä Ar-non cu mäni Ya-bɔk, a räth ni kä A-mon kɛ ɣöö keydiɛn bumɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kɛn wi̱i̱ tɔ̱ diaal ɛ tɔ̱ ka̱n. Kä cukɛ wi̱i̱ ji̱ Ɛ-mor diaal ciɛŋ Ɛc-bon kɛnɛ wi̱i̱kɛ diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn Ɛc-bon ɛ wec Thi-yon kuäär ji̱ Ɛ-mor, mëë ci kɔn nyiëëny kɛ kuäär Mo-ab ëë nhiam, kä cuɛ wi̱i̱kɛ diaal ka̱n kä jɛ, cu mäni Ar-non. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ cu cääk tuaari wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl cieŋ muun ji̱ Ɛ-mor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ nɛy ti wa Ya-dhɛr lim ja̱k. Kä cukɛ jɛ wä ka̱n kɛnɛ wi̱i̱kɛ, kä cukɛ ji̱ Ɛ-mor tin cieŋ thi̱n juɔc raar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ rɔ ri̱t wäkɛ dup Ba-can. Kä cu kuäär Ba-can ni Ög ben kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ diaal, wäkɛ nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kä Ɛ-dhɛ-ri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu Kuoth Nhial Muthɛ jiök i̱, “/Cu dual kɛ jɛ. Kɛ ɣöö cä la̱th tetädu, kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ diaal nikɛ mundɛ. Kä lätni jɛ min ci lät kä Thi-yon kuäär ji̱ Ɛ-mor mëë cieŋ kä Ɛc-bon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cukɛ jɛ näk, kɛnɛ gaatkɛ, kɛ nɛɛkɛ diaal, amäni mëë cuɛ thilɛ ram kɛl mi cu duɔth a tëk kä jɛ. Kä cukɛ wecdɛ ciɛŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
